  "as_of": "2025-03-25",
  "sentences": [
   "This bill would authorise spending from the Consolidated Revenue Fund on government activities that are not part of its everyday running costs.",
   "The amount proposed is roughly five-twelfths of the expected 2025-26 annual funding for those non-ordinary services, with some agencies getting a larger share to cover early-year or urgent needs.",
   "The explanatory memorandum notes that the remaining seven-twelfths plus new budget measures for 2025-26 would be covered by a separate bill later in the year."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "Authorises appropriations from the Consolidated Revenue Fund for non-ordinary annual services.",
   "Provides about five-twelfths of the estimated 2025-26 annual appropriations for those services.",
   "Allows a higher proportion for certain entities, such as the National Emergency Management Agency, that have high early-year spending or need flexibility."
  ],
  "affected": "Government entities that provide services not classified as ordinary annual services of the Government.",
